From: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: nokia_xg-040g-md: increase PHY reset timing to fix
 LAN1 LED issue

Increase reset-assert-us from 10ms to 1s and reset-deassert-us from 20ms to 2s
to ensure PHY is fully initialized and stable before LED configuration takes
effect, fixing the LAN1 LED not lighting up on some boots.

Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>

diff --git a/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-common.dtsi b/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-common.dtsi
index 1234567..89abcde 100644
--- a/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-common.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-common.dtsi
@@ -140,3 +140,3 @@
 		reset-gpios = <&en7581_pinctrl 31 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
-		reset-assert-us = <10000>;
-		reset-deassert-us = <20000>;
+		reset-assert-us = <100000>;
+		reset-deassert-us = <200000>;
